{"ticker":"REGN","updated":"2026-10-23T23:57:19Z","profile":{"longName":"Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc.","shortName":"Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"United States","website":"https://www.regeneron.com","fullTimeEmployees":15410,"marketCap":82880831488,"trailingPE":19.906528,"forwardPE":12.838866,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.3352065,"pegRatio":1.4,"targetMeanPrice":867.3333,"targetHighPrice":1030.0,"targetLowPrice":730.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.167,"earningsGrowth":-0.045,"grossMargins":0.44458,"operatingMargins":0.33106,"profitMargins":0.27865,"totalRevenue":15534699520,"beta":0.153,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":859.34,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":575.93,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.46},"summary":"Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc. discovers, invents, develops, manufactures, and commercializes medicines to treat various diseases worldwide. The company develops product candidates to treat eye, allergic and inflammatory, cardiovascular, metabolic, neurological, infectious, and rare diseases; and cancer, hematologic conditions. It also offers EYLEA injections for wet age-related macular degeneration and diabetic macular edema; myopic choroidal neovascularization; diabetic retinopathy; neovascular glaucoma; retinopathy of prematurity; Dupixent injection to treat atopic dermatitis and asthma; Libtayo injection for metastatic or locally advanced cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma; Praluent injection to treat heterozygous familial hypercholesterolemia (HoFH); and Kevzara solution for rheumatoid arthritis. It has license and collaboration agreement with Bayer for the development and commercialization of EYLEA 8 mg and EYLEA; Alnylam Pharmaceuticals, Inc. to discover, develop, and commercialize RNAi therapeutics for diseases by addressing therapeutic disease targets expressed in eye and central nervous system; Intellia Therapeutics, Inc. to advance CRISPR/Cas9 gene-editing technology for in vivo therapeutic development for therapies focused on neurological and muscular diseases; Hansoh Pharmaceuticals Group Company Limited to acquire development and commercial rights for HS-20094, a ","summary_zh":"Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc. 發現、發明、開發、製造和商業化用於治療全球各種疾病的藥物。該公司開發治療眼科、過敏和發炎、心血管、代謝、神經、傳染病和罕見疾病的候選產品；以及癌症、血液系統疾病。它還提供 EYLEA 注射劑，用於治療濕性老年性黃斑部病變和糖尿病性黃斑水腫；近視脈絡膜新生血管；糖尿病視網膜病變；新生血管性青光眼；早產兒視網膜病變; Dupixent注射液治療特應性皮膚炎和哮喘；新生血管性注射液用於治療性高氧性關節炎（Hoeva）家族性治療晚期鱗狀細胞癌；溶液。與拜耳就 EYLEA 8 mg 和 EYLEA 的開發和商業化簽訂了許可和合作協議； Alnylam Pharmaceuticals, Inc. 通過解決眼睛和中樞神經系統中表達的治療疾病靶點來發現、開發和商業化 RNAi 疾病療法； Intellia Therapeutics, Inc. 將 CRISPR/Cas9 基因編輯技術公司獲得的開發與商業權，HS-20094 是一種","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"生物技術","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":591.06,"h":594.88,"l":572.25,"c":572.38,"v":880900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":573.0,"h":588.1,"l":567.08,"c":587.65,"v":1614400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":591.87,"h":597.02,"l":585.5,"c":586.96,"v":584100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":586.43,"h":590.96,"l":575.04,"c":579.61,"v":616600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":577.15,"h":581.25,"l":575.89,"c":580.7,"v":574300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":580.54,"h":585.49,"l":570.35,"c":577.9,"v":1020200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":581.99,"h":588.7,"l":562.79,"c":563.8,"v":1118500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":568.01,"h":581.98,"l":559.62,"c":567.22,"v":1124300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":565.15,"h":577.75,"l":565.0,"c":573.38,"v":960400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":571.2,"h":571.2,"l":552.81,"c":558.44,"v":1250400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":557.0,"h":563.57,"l":554.8,"c":556.53,"v":873200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":555.21,"h":560.0,"l":552.98,"c":555.83,"v":874700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":555.81,"h":570.76,"l":555.81,"c":568.2,"v":868200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":567.34,"h":570.0,"l":559.45,"c":560.0,"v":602600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":558.54,"h":573.69,"l":558.54,"c":572.59,"v":995700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":573.43,"h":579.4,"l":567.3,"c":575.06,"v":707900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":576.31,"h":587.67,"l":576.31,"c":585.5,"v":92150